{"id":"4e358684550f1aca","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-nrandom-jump.md","title":"n 随机点不由较低跳跃计算","display":"thm-nrandom-jump — n 随机点不由较低跳跃计算","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-nrandom-jump","aliases":["43-thm-nrandom-jump"],"display":"thm-nrandom-jump — n 随机点不由较低跳跃计算","depends_on":["[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-nrandom-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-nrandom-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nrandom-jump — n 随机点不由较低跳跃计算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；n随机性、跳跃与归约见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span> 是由正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 索引的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上布尔谓词族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\Rightarrow X\\nleq_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\Rightarrow X\\nleq_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若可计算，则相对该预言机的柱集单点检验捕捉X；这是非可计算性论证的相对化。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；n随机性、跳跃与归约见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；n随机性、跳跃与归约见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；n随机性、跳跃与归约见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\Rightarrow X\\nleq_T\\varnothing^{(n-1)}.","display":true}],"bytes":1221,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-nrandom-jump]] — n 随机点不由较低跳跃计算"},{"id":"29b1f351c8b815d1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["86bdc33f83ee57a9","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}